		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">4</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer. The difference between 26 and 21 is 5 but the difference between 30 and 26 is 4. So, 21, 26, 30, 35 are not in arithmetic progression.</attribute>
