		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">22</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer.
a is of number type, so a+a will do arithmetic addition. Thus, 5+5 will give 10.
But b is of string type, so b+b will do string addition. Thus "5"+"5" will give "55".
Note the use of double quotes for b and no double quotes for a.</attribute>
